<title>INDIA: TENNIS-INDIAN OPEN QUARTERFINAL RESULTS.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-INDIAN OPEN QUARTERFINAL RESULTS.</headline>
<dateline>MADRAS, India 1997-04-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Quarter-final results in the $430,000 Indian Open men's tennis tournament on Friday (prefix number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>5-Alex Radulescu (Germany) beat 3-MaliVai Washington (U.S.) 6-3 6-4</p>
<p>Andrei Pavel (Romania) beat 7-Magnus Norman (Sweden) 6-0 6-2</p>
<p>6-Mikael Tillstrom (Sweden) beat 4-Jonathan Stark (U.S.) 7-5 6-3</p>
<p>Gerard Solves (France) beat Rainer Schuttler (Germany) 6-4 1-6 6-2</p>
</text>
